<title>USA: Coca-Cola Co Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Co Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net			987,000		  713,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,138,000		4,224,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,480		    2,503</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus estimate $0.38</p>
<p>1997 Q1 includes gain of $0.08 a share due to completion of sale of 49 percent interest in Coca-Cola &amp; Schweppes Beverages to Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc.</p>
